<title>USA: Unitrin Inc Q3 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Unitrin Inc Q3 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.65		    $0.37</p>
<p> Oper net		  24,200		   14,700</p>
<p> Revs		     378,800		  354,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,358		   39,523</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 oper results exclude net income from investees of $13.7 million or $0.36/shr vs $11.9 million or $0.30/shr, and income from sales of investments of $200,000 or $0.01/shr vs $13.4 million or $0.34/shr.  </p>
<p>9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.47		    $1.09</p>
<p> Oper net		  55,500		   44,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,141,500		1,066,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,865		   40,921</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month oper results exclude income from investees of $36.5 million or $0.96/shr vs $32.5 million or $0.80/shr, and income from sale of investments of $1 million or $0.03/shr vs $35.5 million or $0.87/shr.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
